<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p data-start="228" data-end="236" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi Team,</p>
<p data-start="235" data-end="351" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">After reviewing the quote - {!Quote.Name}, we've decided not to move forward with approval at this time.</p><p data-start="353" data-end="508" style=""><font face="arial">{!Quote.Link}</font></p><p data-start="353" data-end="508" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">While the proposal had its merits (and gave our budget a good cardio workout), it doesn’t align with our current scope, priorities, or cost expectations.</p><p data-start="510" data-end="696" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you to everyone who reviewed and provided feedback - much appreciated. If there are alternatives worth exploring or adjustments we can suggest back to the vendor, happy to discuss.</p><p data-start="238" data-end="333" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">


</p><p data-start="698" data-end="757" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Let’s regroup as needed to determine the best path forward.</p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://solmillenium2--partial.sandbox.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015be000002tyAT&amp;oid=00Dbe000000ANL7" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
